Getting immunity from disintegration will only save yourself from the 
black dragon breath, not your shield and armor (or shirt).

The direct way to minimize the chance of armor being disintegrated by 
spell casters, like Golden Naga, Titan(Nasty armor destroyer), is to kill
them as soon as you saw them. Use wands or spells if far away. Or keep away 
from them. I don't think you will get your armour disintegrated if they
out of sight, though you might hear their mumblings.



